@host = http://localhost:5197
@email = demo@test.local
@password = Pa$$w0rd-1

### 1. Rejestracja
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 2. Logowanie - skopiuj accessToken i refreshToken poniżej
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@accessToken = paste-access-token
@refreshToken = paste-refresh-token

### 3. Endpoint chroniony - pokazuje token_version i sid z tokenu
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Rotacja refresh tokena (drugie wywołanie z tym samym tokenem = wykrycie kradzieży)
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### 5. Wylogowanie tego urządzenia (usuwa rodzinę = sid)
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Wylogowanie wszędzie (token_version + 1) - potem krok 3 zwraca 401
POST {{host}}/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Zmiana hasła (token_version + 1)
POST {{host}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "{{password}}", "newPassword": "N3w-Pa$$w0rd" }
